	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Nnh... gh...)”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A thunderous roar reverberates in my ears.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A sensation like seasickness overwhelms me, and I can't even tell up from down.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"All that I can perceive is a slick liquid trickling down my forehead.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(What... happened?)”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I unthinkingly breathe in an acrid lungful of smoke, and I struggle to blink back the tears.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"All I can see through my blurry vision are the hazy outlines of people fleeing in panic.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"I catch the glimpse of someone's legs approaching me.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Military boots... An officer?",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Help... me...)”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I must have inhaled too much smoke, as my hoarse throat barely manages to croak out the words.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"I try to reach out my hand, but my body refuses to listen.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"As though blotted out by ink, my vision begins to close in from the edges.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"I suppose this is the end for me...",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Onii-sama... Oh, how your Kanami... yearns to see you... one last...)”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"Well? A splendid little fireworks show, don't you think?",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"Oh, please... We're only just getting started.",
			},
		},
